  "design_notes": [
    "The table has an \"Effect\" column instead of Strengths; its cells are stored as strengths. The \"Fact\" column is stored in twin.",
    "Option names keep the \"+\" of the table: fins and grid fins are added to the engine gimbal, which every vehicle has.",
    "Only grid fins have a number ($2 M). \"+stability in atmosphere\", \"+drag\" and \"+mass\" are flags; the design gives no mass or drag figure.",
    "\"Required for propulsive booster return\" is enforced from the other side: both propulsive options of booster_recovery carry requires_part aero_grid_fins. Booster recovery is voted at step 15 and steering at step 18, so Core has to force or pre-select grid fins once a propulsive recovery is chosen.",
    "No option is restricted to a contract. Engine gimbal only has no model path: it adds no hardware to the rocket."
  ],
